# Beats — arrival / the door
#
# The Captcha bot gatekeeps the entrance. Passing it earns verification;
# being a smartass earns heat — and heat is the only thing that can ever
# get you locked down.

== captcha_gate(guest)
  cast: Captcha, guest
  CAPTCHA
    BEEP. Prove you are human.
    Select every square that contains a traffic light.
  * Tap the traffic lights
    <set: guest.karma += 10>
    <set: guest.verified = true>
    <respond: CAPTCHA passed — verified human.>
  * Paste a wall of emoji
    The Algorithm does not appreciate cleverness.
    <set: guest.heat += 40>
    -> lockdown
